sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant PB as Phone Browser
    participant WA as QR Web App
    participant AG as API Gateway
    participant AS as Auth Service
    participant MS as Menu Service
    participant OS as Order Service
    participant TS as Table Service
    participant PS as Payment Service
    participant SS as Socket Server
    participant KDS as KDS Display
    participant WA_APP as Waiter App
    participant Redis
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    C->>PB: Scans QR code on table (branch_id + table_id)
    PB->>WA: Opens URL
    WA->>AG: GET /api/v1/qr/resolve?branch_id=X&table_id=Y
    AG->>TS: Validate Table & Branch
    TS->>DB: Query table status
    DB-->>TS: Table active
    TS-->>AG: Valid
    AG->>AS: Generate Guest Session (No login)
    AS->>Redis: Store session
    AS-->>AG: JWT (Guest Token)
    AG-->>WA: Table Info + JWT

    WA->>AG: GET /api/v1/menu (with JWT)
    AG->>MS: Fetch Menu (time-based, branch specific)
    MS->>Redis: Check Cache
    alt Cache Hit
        Redis-->>MS: Menu Data
    else Cache Miss
        MS->>DB: Fetch categories, items, modifiers
        DB-->>MS: Menu Data
        MS->>Redis: Set Cache
    end
    MS-->>AG: Filtered Menu Data
    AG-->>WA: Render Menu
    
    C->>WA: Browses categories, views item details (images, allergens)
    C->>WA: Adds items to cart, selects modifiers (size, extras)
    C->>WA: Reviews cart, applies coupon
    WA->>AG: POST /api/v1/cart/coupon
    AG->>OS: Validate Coupon
    OS-->>AG: Valid (discount calculated)
    AG-->>WA: Discount applied

    C->>WA: Submit Order
    WA->>AG: POST /api/v1/orders
    AG->>OS: Create Order
    OS->>DB: Check stock availability
    alt Item Out of Stock
        DB-->>OS: Insufficient Stock
        OS-->>AG: Error: Out of Stock
        AG-->>WA: Show out of stock error
    else Stock Available
        OS->>OS: Calculate taxes & discounts
        OS->>DB: Insert Order (Status: PLACED)
        DB-->>OS: order_number
        OS->>SS: Emit 'new-order' (branch KDS room)
        OS->>SS: Emit 'new-order' (waiter room for section)
        OS-->>AG: Order Success
        AG-->>WA: Show PLACED status
    end

    SS->>KDS: Event: new-order
    SS->>WA_APP: Event: new-order
    
    KDS->>OS: Kitchen Staff Acknowledges
    OS->>DB: Update Status -> PREPARING
    OS->>SS: Emit 'order-status-changed'
    SS->>WA: Show PREPARING status
    
    KDS->>OS: Mark item ready
    OS->>DB: Update item status
    
    KDS->>OS: All items ready
    OS->>DB: Update Status -> READY
    OS->>SS: Emit 'order-ready'
    SS->>WA: Show READY status
    SS->>WA_APP: Notify Waiter to serve

    WA_APP->>OS: Waiter serves food
    OS->>DB: Update Status -> SERVED
    
    C->>WA: Add more items (append to same order)
    WA->>AG: PUT /api/v1/orders/{id}/items
    AG->>OS: Append Items
    OS->>DB: Update Order
    OS->>SS: Emit 'new-items' to KDS
    
    C->>WA: Request Bill
    WA->>AG: GET /api/v1/orders/{id}/bill
    AG->>OS: Generate Bill
    OS->>DB: Fetch order details
    OS-->>AG: Bill with tax breakdown
    AG-->>WA: Display Bill
    
    C->>WA: Select Payment (Option A: Online Razorpay)
    WA->>AG: POST /api/v1/payments/init
    AG->>PS: Create Payment Intent
    PS->>WA: Redirect to Gateway (e.g. Razorpay)
    alt Payment Failure
        WA->>PS: Webhook: Failed
        PS->>OS: Log failure
        OS-->>WA: Show payment failed
    else Payment Success
        WA->>PS: Webhook: Success
        PS->>OS: Confirm Payment
        OS->>DB: Update Status -> COMPLETED
        OS->>SS: Emit 'order-completed'
        SS->>WA_APP: Notify Waiter (Table Free)
        OS-->>WA: Show Payment Success
    end
    
    WA->>C: Show Rating Prompt
    C->>WA: Submit Rating
    WA->>AG: POST /api/v1/ratings
    
    OS->>Redis: Clean up guest session
